### 4. Contains Duplicate — LeetCode #217

**Pattern:** HashSet

**Question:** Return `true` if any value appears at least twice.

```java
class Solution {
    public boolean containsDuplicate(int[] nums) {

        HashSet<Integer> set = new HashSet<>();

        for (int num : nums) {

            if (set.contains(num)) {
                return true;
            }

            set.add(num);
        }

        return false;
    }
}
```

**Example:**

```text
Input:  [1,2,3,1]
Output: true
```

**Idea:**
Already irukkura number again vandha → duplicate.

**Time:** `O(n)`
**Space:** `O(n)`

